# Graph-admission verifier scratch (A2-294c). The ChangeAdmissionReceipt's verifier outputs under
# receipts/graph/verifier-out/ ARE committed evidence -- DEC-AUP-0037 R1 requires the gate to be able
# to open them at head. The two RelationshipGraph dumps verify.py drops in the same directory are not:
# they are ~2 MB of scratch each, nothing in the gate opens receipt.graph.path (it rebuilds the graph
# itself and compares graph_digest), and this is the program repository's own convention.
receipts/graph/verifier-out/**/graph-*.json
